model {
  extend basalt.modelGateway {
    metadata {
      constraint "Every pool-token request checks current organization existence and removal tombstones through signed host authority before any endpoint read or write. Erasing and deleted organizations return 403 immediately; lookup failures refuse access, and successful checks are never cached. The disposable Cloud regression provisions the stable NOLOGIN history owner with schema USAGE and CREATE, matching production migration ownership."
    }
  }
}
